    "updated_at": "2026-11-26T17:44:40Z",
    "body": "Batch 3 is ready for review in https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/pull/4203.\n\nCoverage:\n- #3833: 2D Contour outside ramp and entry limits.\n- #3861: Command line, Control a running window.\n- #3900 and #3903: Tools, separate library window and tool editor.\n- #3496: Rotary Offset Zigzag closing rings.\n- #3516 and #3579: 2D Pocket protected picks and missed corner reliefs.\n- #3762: Troubleshooting, GPU compute fallback.\n\nThe focused site gate passes all 65 tests. Zola 0.23.6 builds the site. Navigation, internal links and anchors pass.\nThe full site suite reports the same three failures as the unchanged base: two rotary icon mismatches and the missing `manualToolChange` reference row.\n\nThis PR covers only these eight entries. The umbrella and its remaining checklist stay open. I did not edit the checklist or change CAM code.\n",
